  title "The Tower Between Factions"
  summary "Qing, a crystal-worker at the Perch in Aurora Stack, navigates her daily routine of maintaining fire-cores and aurora-crystals while living among the Pinnacle—a faction that chose to remain after a schism split Qingfu'spire. When a Nightshelf trader brings a corrupted crystal from a previous shipment, Qing provides clean alternatives and receives a fully charged fire-core in return. Later, Qing uses the Mechanism Refine technique to repair a fractured fire-core through precise channeling of aurora-light, demonstrating the careful, costly work required to maintain the Perch's operations. As evening falls and the aurora dims, Qing sits alone in the darkening galleries, a survivor of the tower's division who chose to stay despite the isolation and loss that followed."
